rSshTerm AppImage: third-party notices

The rSshTerm AppImage includes the third-party software listed below, and in addition bundles shared libraries from
Ubuntu (GTK 4, libadwaita, VTE, GLib, Pango, Cairo, HarfBuzz, FreeRDP, libusb and their dependencies). Those are
listed with their exact Ubuntu package versions, their copyright files and the LGPL/GPL texts in usr/share/doc/ of the
AppImage (bundled-libraries/), together with the written offer for their source code (SOURCE-OFFER.txt). They stay
separate shared libraries that you may replace (extract with --appimage-extract).

